### Test 1: Pasajero GOLD con retraso de 120 minutos (Dispara la regla)
POST http://localhost:8080/airline/api/evaluate-ai
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passenger": {
    "name": "Carlos Gómez",
    "membershipStatus": "GOLD"
  },
  "flight": {
    "flightNumber": "UD-123",
    "delayMinutes": 120
  },
  "baggageWeight": 20.0
}

